-- Seed song details
--
-- Sample data for the song-lists demo: featured artists, covers, and film/TV
-- productions for the songs seeded in 0003_seed_artists_and_songs.sql, plus
-- each song's iTunes lookup result (album art, album, and year, or that
-- nothing was found), so a fresh database needs no lookup run.
-- Rows resolve their foreign keys through resource_id, so the serial IDs are
-- free to differ.


